,"https://github.com",["Date","2026-03-01T00:00:00.000Z"],true,"这是一个使用 Astro 框架构建的个人技术博客。","src/content/projects/personal-blog.md","71d91e08bcee3d46",{"html":27,"metadata":28},"\u003Cp>这是一个使用 Astro 框架构建的个人技术博客。\u003C/p>",{"headings":29,"localImagePaths":30,"remoteImagePaths":31,"frontmatter":32,"imagePaths":35},[],[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"techs":33,"github":20,"date":34,"featured":22},[17,18,19],["Date","2026-03-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[],"personal-blog.md","blog",["Map",39,40,78,79,117,118,162,163],"react-hooks-deep-dive",{"id":39,"data":41,"body":49,"filePath":50,"digest":51,"rendered":52,"legacyId":77},{"title":42,"description":43,"date":44,"category":45,"tags":46,"featured":22,"draft":48},"React Hooks 深入理解与实践","深入解析 React Hooks 的工作原理，包括 useState、useEffect、useRef 等常用 Hooks 的使用场景和注意事项。",["Date","2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z"],"前端",[47,19],"React",false,"## 什么是 Hooks\n\nReact Hooks 是 React 16.8 引入的新特性，它让我们可以在函数组件中使用 state 和其他 React 特性。在 Hooks 之前，我们只能通过类组件来使用这些功能。\n\n## useState 的使用\n\n`useState` 是最基本的 Hook，它让我们在函数组件中添加 state。\n\n```jsx\nconst [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n```\n\nuseState 接受一个初始值，返回一个数组，包含当前状态和一个更新状态的函数。\n\n## useEffect 的细节\n\n`useEffect` 用于处理副作用，比如数据获取、订阅、手动 DOM 操作等。\n\n```jsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  // 副作用逻辑\n  return () => {\n    // 清理逻辑\n  };\n}, [dependencies]);\n```\n\n## 自定义 Hooks\n\n自定义 Hook 是一个以 `use` 开头的函数，其内部可以调用其他 Hook。通过自定义 Hook，我们可以复用有状态逻辑。\n\n## 总结\n\nHooks 让我们能够更简洁地编写 React 组件，同时保持逻辑的可复用性。","src/content/blog/react-hooks-deep-dive.md","9196eae0facdac7c",{"html":53,"metadata":54},"\u003Ch2 id=\"什么是-hooks\">什么是 Hooks\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>React Hooks 是 React 16.8 引入的新特性，它让我们可以在函数组件中使用 state 和其他 React 特性。在 Hooks 之前，我们只能通过类组件来使用这些功能。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usestate-的使用\">useState 的使用\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>useState\u003C/code> 是最基本的 Hook，它让我们在函数组件中添加 state。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"jsx\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">count\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">setCount\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> useState\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>useState 接受一个初始值，返回一个数组，包含当前状态和一个更新状态的函数。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"useeffect-的细节\">useEffect 的细节\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>useEffect\u003C/code> 用于处理副作用，比如数据获取、订阅、手动 DOM 操作等。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"jsx\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">useEffect\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(() \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // 副作用逻辑\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\">    // 清理逻辑\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  };\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}, [dependencies]);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"自定义-hooks\">自定义 Hooks\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>自定义 Hook 是一个以 \u003Ccode>use\u003C/code> 开头的函数，其内部可以调用其他 Hook。通过自定义 Hook，我们可以复用有状态逻辑。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Hooks 让我们能够更简洁地编写 React 组件，同时保持逻辑的可复用性。\u003C/p>",{"headings":55,"localImagePaths":71,"remoteImagePaths":72,"frontmatter":73,"imagePaths":76},[56,60,63,66,69],{"depth":57,"slug":58,"text":59},2,"什么是-hooks","什么是 Hooks",{"depth":57,"slug":61,"text":62},"usestate-的使用","useState 的使用",{"depth":57,"slug":64,"text":65},"useeffect-的细节","useEffect 的细节",{"depth":57,"slug":67,"text":68},"自定义-hooks","自定义 Hooks",{"depth":57,"slug":70,"text":70},"总结",[],[],{"title":42,"description":43,"date":74,"category":45,"tags":75,"featured":22},["Date","2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z"],[47,19],[],"react-hooks-deep-dive.md","typescript-advanced-types",{"id":78,"data":80,"body":85,"filePath":86,"digest":87,"rendered":88,"legacyId":116},{"title":81,"description":82,"date":83,"category":45,"tags":84,"featured":22,"draft":48},"TypeScript 类型体操入门指南","学习如何在 TypeScript 中使用高级类型、条件类型和映射类型进行类型编程。",["Date","2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z"],[19],"## 为什么需要类型编程\n\nTypeScript 不仅是一门静态类型语言，它还提供了强大的类型系统。通过类型编程，我们可以实现复杂的类型逻辑，让编译器帮助我们检查代码中的潜在问题。\n\n## 基础类型操作\n\n### 泛型\n\n泛型是类型编程的基础，它允许我们创建可复用的类型组件。\n\n```typescript\nfunction identity\u003CT>(arg: T): T {\n  return arg;\n}\n```\n\n### 条件类型\n\n条件类型可以根据其他类型来决定最终的类型。\n\n```typescript\ntype NonNullable\u003CT> = T extends null | undefined ? never : T;\n```\n\n## 进阶技巧\n\n### 映射类型\n\n映射类型可以让我们批量转换类型的属性。\n\n```typescript\ntype Readonly\u003CT> = {\n  readonly [P in keyof T]: T[P];\n};\n```\n\n### infer 关键字\n\n`infer` 关键字允许我们在条件类型中提取类型。\n\n```typescript\ntype ReturnType\u003CT> = T extends (...args: any[]) => infer R ? R : never;\n```\n\n## 实战应用\n\n在实际项目中，类型编程可以帮助我们实现：\n\n1. 自动推导 API 返回类型\n2. 自动化表单验证\n3. 路由参数类型检查\n\n掌握这些技巧可以让你的 TypeScript 代码更加类型安全。","src/content/blog/typescript-advanced-types.md","b058a79bbf93ffb1",{"html":89,"metadata":90},"\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么需要类型编程\">为什么需要类型编程\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>TypeScript 不仅是一门静态类型语言，它还提供了强大的类型系统。通过类型编程，我们可以实现复杂的类型逻辑，让编译器帮助我们检查代码中的潜在问题。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"基础类型操作\">基础类型操作\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"泛型\">泛型\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>泛型是类型编程的基础，它允许我们创建可复用的类型组件。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"typescript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">function\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> identity\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">arg\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> arg;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"条件类型\">条件类型\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>条件类型可以根据其他类型来决定最终的类型。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"typescript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">type\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> NonNullable\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> extends\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> null\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> |\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> undefined\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> ?\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> never\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> :\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"进阶技巧\">进阶技巧\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"映射类型\">映射类型\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>映射类型可以让我们批量转换类型的属性。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"typescript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">type\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> Readonly\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  readonly\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">P\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> in\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> keyof\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">P\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">];\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"infer-关键字\">infer 关键字\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>infer\u003C/code> 关键字允许我们在条件类型中提取类型。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"typescript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">type\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> ReturnType\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> T\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> extends\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">...\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">args\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> any\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[]) \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> infer\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> R\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> ?\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> R\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> :\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> never\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"实战应用\">实战应用\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>在实际项目中，类型编程可以帮助我们实现：\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>自动推导 API 返回类型\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>自动化表单验证\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>路由参数类型检查\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>掌握这些技巧可以让你的 TypeScript 代码更加类型安全。\u003C/p>",{"headings":91,"localImagePaths":110,"remoteImagePaths":111,"frontmatter":112,"imagePaths":115},[92,94,96,99,101,103,105,108],{"depth":57,"slug":93,"text":93},"为什么需要类型编程",{"depth":57,"slug":95,"text":95},"基础类型操作",{"depth":97,"slug":98,"text":98},3,"泛型",{"depth":97,"slug":100,"text":100},"条件类型",{"depth":57,"slug":102,"text":102},"进阶技巧",{"depth":97,"slug":104,"text":104},"映射类型",{"depth":97,"slug":106,"text":107},"infer-关键字","infer 关键字",{"depth":57,"slug":109,"text":109},"实战应用",[],[],{"title":81,"description":82,"date":113,"category":45,"tags":114,"featured":22},["Date","2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z"],[19],[],"typescript-advanced-types.md","frontend-performance",{"id":117,"data":119,"body":125,"filePath":126,"digest":127,"rendered":128,"legacyId":161},{"title":120,"description":121,"date":122,"category":45,"tags":123,"featured":22,"draft":48},"前端性能优化完全指南","从加载性能、渲染性能、交互性能三个维度全面提升网页性能的方法与实践。",["Date","2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[124,47],"性能优化","## 为什么要性能优化\n\n用户对网页加载速度的期望越来越高。研究表明，如果页面加载超过 3 秒，超过 50% 的用户会选择离开。\n\n## 加载性能优化\n\n### 代码分割\n\n使用动态导入实现按需加载：\n\n```javascript\nconst Component = lazy(() => import('./Component'));\n```\n\n### 缓存策略\n\n合理设置 Cache-Control：\n\n```\nCache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable\n```\n\n### 资源压缩\n\n启用 Gzip/Brotli 压缩，减小资源体积。\n\n## 渲染性能优化\n\n### 避免重排和重绘\n\n```javascript\n// 避免\nelement.style.width = '100px';\nelement.style.height = '100px';\n\n// 推荐：合并 DOM 操作\nelement.style.cssText = 'width: 100px; height: 100px;';\n```\n\n### 使用 CSS 硬件加速\n\n```css\n.transform {\n  transform: translateZ(0);\n  will-change: transform;\n}\n```\n\n## 交互性能优化\n\n### 事件防抖\n\n对于频繁触发的事件（如 resize、scroll），使用防抖：\n\n```javascript\nconst debounce = (fn, delay) => {\n  let timer = null;\n  return (...args) => {\n    clearTimeout(timer);\n    timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), delay);\n  };\n};\n```\n\n## 性能监控\n\n使用 Lighthouse 和 Web Vitals 持续监控性能：\n\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint)\n- FID (First Input Delay)\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift)\n\n性能优化是一个持续的过程，需要不断地测量、分析和改进。","src/content/blog/frontend-performance.md","1c30603416e91a69",{"html":129,"metadata":130},"\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么要性能优化\">为什么要性能优化\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>用户对网页加载速度的期望越来越高。研究表明，如果页面加载超过 3 秒，超过 50% 的用户会选择离开。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"加载性能优化\">加载性能优化\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"代码分割\">代码分割\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>使用动态导入实现按需加载：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"javascript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> Component\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> lazy\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(() \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'./Component'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>合理设置 Cache-Control：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"资源压缩\">资源压缩\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>启用 Gzip/Brotli 压缩，减小资源体积。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"渲染性能优化\">渲染性能优化\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"避免重排和重绘\">避免重排和重绘\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"javascript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\">// 避免\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">element.style.width \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> '100px'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">element.style.height \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> '100px'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\">// 推荐：合并 DOM 操作\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">element.style.cssText \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 'width: 100px; height: 100px;'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"使用-css-硬件加速\">使用 CSS 硬件加速\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">.transform\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  transform\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">translateZ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  will-change\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: transform;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"交互性能优化\">交互性能优化\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"事件防抖\">事件防抖\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>对于频繁触发的事件（如 resize、scroll），使用防抖：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"javascript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> debounce\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">fn\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">delay\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  let\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> timer \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> null\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">...\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">args\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">    clearTimeout\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(timer);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    timer \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> setTimeout\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(() \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> fn\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">...\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">args), delay);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  };\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"性能监控\">性能监控\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>使用 Lighthouse 和 Web Vitals 持续监控性能：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>LCP (Largest Contentful Paint)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>FID (First Input Delay)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift)\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>性能优化是一个持续的过程，需要不断地测量、分析和改进。\u003C/p>",{"headings":131,"localImagePaths":155,"remoteImagePaths":156,"frontmatter":157,"imagePaths":160},[132,134,136,138,140,142,144,146,149,151,153],{"depth":57,"slug":133,"text":133},"为什么要性能优化",{"depth":57,"slug":135,"text":135},"加载性能优化",{"depth":97,"slug":137,"text":137},"代码分割",{"depth":97,"slug":139,"text":139},"缓存策略",{"depth":97,"slug":141,"text":141},"资源压缩",{"depth":57,"slug":143,"text":143},"渲染性能优化",{"depth":97,"slug":145,"text":145},"避免重排和重绘",{"depth":97,"slug":147,"text":148},"使用-css-硬件加速","使用 CSS 硬件加速",{"depth":57,"slug":150,"text":150},"交互性能优化",{"depth":97,"slug":152,"text":152},"事件防抖",{"depth":57,"slug":154,"text":154},"性能监控",[],[],{"title":120,"description":121,"date":158,"category":45,"tags":159,"featured":22},["Date","2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[124,47],[],"frontend-performance.md","docker-getting-started",{"id":162,"data":164,"body":171,"filePath":172,"digest":173,"rendered":174,"legacyId":206},{"title":165,"description":166,"date":167,"category":168,"tags":169,"featured":48,"draft":48},"Docker 从入门到实践","详细介绍 Docker 的核心概念、常用命令以及如何编写 Dockerfile 和 docker-compose.yml。",["Date","2026-04-05T00:00:00.000Z"],"DevOps",[170,168],"Docker","## Docker 简介\n\nDocker 是一个开源的容器化平台，它允许我们将应用及其依赖打包成轻量级的容器，实现快速部署和迁移。\n\n## 核心概念\n\n### 镜像 (Image)\n\n镜像是只读的模板，包含了运行应用所需的所有依赖。\n\n```bash\ndocker pull nginx:latest\ndocker images\n```\n\n### 容器 (Container)\n\n容器是镜像的运行实例。\n\n```bash\ndocker run -d -p 80:80 nginx:latest\ndocker ps\n```\n\n### 仓库 (Registry)\n\n仓库用于存储和分发镜像，Docker Hub 是最大的公共仓库。\n\n## Dockerfile 入门\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:20-alpine\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\nCOPY . .\nEXPOSE 3000\nCMD [\"npm\", \"start\"]\n```\n\n## Docker Compose\n\n```yaml\nversion: '3.8'\nservices:\n  web:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n  db:\n    image: postgres:15\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: secret\n```\n\n## 常用命令\n\n| 命令 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| docker ps | 查看运行中的容器 |\n| docker logs | 查看容器日志 |\n| docker exec | 进入容器内部 |\n| docker-compose up | 启动服务 |\n\n通过 Docker，我们可以实现开发环境的一致性，大大减少\"在我机器上能运行\"的问题。","src/content/blog/docker-getting-started.md","73c6caadf2d00e18",{"html":175,"metadata":176},"\u003Ch2 id=\"docker-简介\">Docker 简介\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Docker 是一个开源的容器化平台，它允许我们将应用及其依赖打包成轻量级的容器，实现快速部署和迁移。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"镜像-image\">镜像 (Image)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>镜像是只读的模板，包含了运行应用所需的所有依赖。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">docker\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> pull\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:latest\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">docker\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> images\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"容器-container\">容器 (Container)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>容器是镜像的运行实例。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">docker\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> run\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -d\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -p\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 80:80\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:latest\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">docker\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> ps\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"仓库-registry\">仓库 (Registry)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>仓库用于存储和分发镜像，Docker Hub 是最大的公共仓库。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dockerfile-入门\">Dockerfile 入门\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"dockerfile\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">FROM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> node:20-alpine\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">WORKDIR\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> /app\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">COPY\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> package*.json ./\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">RUN\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> npm install\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">COPY\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> . .\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">EXPOSE\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> 3000\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">CMD\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"npm\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"start\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"docker-compose\">Docker Compose\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"yaml\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">version\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">services\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  web\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    build\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    ports\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"3000:3000\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  db\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    image\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">postgres:15\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    environment\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_PASSWORD\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">secret\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"常用命令\">常用命令\u003C/h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003Ctable>\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>命令\u003C/th>\u003Cth>说明\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>docker ps\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>查看运行中的容器\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>docker logs\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>查看容器日志\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>docker exec\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>进入容器内部\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>docker-compose up\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>启动服务\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\u003Cp>通过 Docker，我们可以实现开发环境的一致性，大大减少”在我机器上能运行”的问题。\u003C/p>",{"headings":177,"localImagePaths":200,"remoteImagePaths":201,"frontmatter":202,"imagePaths":205},[178,181,183,186,189,192,195,198],{"depth":57,"slug":179,"text":180},"docker-简介","Docker 简介",{"depth":57,"slug":182,"text":182},"核心概念",{"depth":97,"slug":184,"text":185},"镜像-image","镜像 (Image)",{"depth":97,"slug":187,"text":188},"容器-container","容器 (Container)",{"depth":97,"slug":190,"text":191},"仓库-registry","仓库 (Registry)",{"depth":57,"slug":193,"text":194},"dockerfile-入门","Dockerfile 入门",{"depth":57,"slug":196,"text":197},"docker-compose","Docker Compose",{"depth":57,"slug":199,"text":199},"常用命令",[],[],{"title":165,"description":166,"date":203,"category":168,"tags":204,"featured":48},["Date","2026-04-05T00:00:00.000Z"],[170,168],[],"docker-getting-started.md"]